# Text inputs → TextEdit

- Every editable text field (search boxes, path inputs, forms) MUST use `crate::ui::text_edit::TextEdit`.
- Do **not** store input/query UI state as a bare `String`.
- Prefer shared chrome `text_input_box` that renders via `TextEdit::render_content`.
- Clipboard / arrows: `TextEdit::handle_key`. Printable + Chinese IME: `EntityInputHandler` on `WorkspaceView` (do not also insert from `key_char`).
- Support caret blink (`caret_visible`), mouse drag select (`set_caret` / `char_index_at_x`), and IME mark (`marked` / `replace_utf16_range`).
- Read-only copyable labels may use `TextEdit` + `handle_key_readonly`.
- Filtering/search reads `.text`.

```rust
// ❌ BAD
process_query: String,

// ✅ GOOD
process_query: TextEdit,
text_input_box(..., &self.process_query, ..., ActiveField::Process, cx)
```
